  description: "Pixies are tiny fae, no larger than a child\u2019s forearm, clearly
    small by any standard, with delicate bodies and shimmering four wings like a
    giant insect\u2019s. They zip and flutter with incredible speed, a blur of motion
    and light whenever they move. They speak in rapid, musical speech, a mix of giggles,
    teasing comments, and sing-song phrases."
